Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.64,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fnIVUDJVCV\c&H424242&\bord2\3c&HF8F8F8&}黑夜国取款机外地毯下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:40.17,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\fnIVUDJVCV\c&H252422&\fs50\pos(960,138)}横谷推测的经济面板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:46.93,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fnIVUDJVCV\c&H252422&\fs50\pos(960,138)}秋山推测的经济面板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:07:01.32,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnIVUDJVCV\c&HFAF8F6&\an7\fs70\frz5.681\fax-0.1\pos(272,223)}中立国账户余额
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:38.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnIVUDJVCV\c&H5E44EE&\pos(1635,408)}卡呢 没带吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:38.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnIVUDJVCV\c&H5E44EE&\pos(945,182)\frz26.33}那箱里不就是没钱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:37.01,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)\fnIVUDJVCV\c&HEE6157&\fs70\pos(567,53)}惊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:16.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnIVUDJVCV\c&H28FACB&\pos(838,24)}嘿嘿 我把卡给对面了
